<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-21328] efalnd: Fixes for datapath edge cases</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21328</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;1. When DMA mapping a Tx failed, its fragment count was left set, so releasing the Tx later tried to unmap fragments that were never mapped.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2. Don't use stale rdma desc for 0 size transfers&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;3. Repost an Rx when it is freed&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;4. Register the MR over the DMA mapped entries&lt;/p&gt;</description>
